    "An ordinary tool failure after an accepted control call is a separate result and never rolls back the committed Map revision.",
    "Retries, resume, fork and compaction never infer task meaning or synthesize Map transitions.",
    "Projection policies may change only provider-context emission; they share the same canonical state and event log."
